  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe source dropdown shows Selection for saved face and edge picks.\nStock and named model sources keep their existing labels.\nThe header controls move to a module to keep both source files below 400 lines.\nThe decision record explains the choice and the rejected alternatives.\n\nEffort: medium\n\n## Cause\n\nThe header forced source kind 2 to the Stock index.\nThe saved selection was intact.\nThe source control had no entry for that selection.\n\n## Tests\n\nPin: `egui_app::tests::geo_row_hover::source_dropdown_shows_selection_for_face_and_edge_picks`.\nThe pin failed before the fix and passed after the fix.\nIt checks face and edge commands, rendered labels, Stock and model sources, undo, and redo.\nMutation: restoring `op_page.rs` from `upstream/main` made the pin fail on the Selection assertion.\nRestoring the fixed file made the pin pass.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 9 steps.\nThe UI library had 1290 passing tests and 7 existing ignored tests.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The `.nc` and `.cl` diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nManual viewport picks on the first-continuous-4axis-part example were not exercised.\nPhysical source popup clicks and GPU snapshots were not exercised.\nThe pin sends the existing geometry and source commands through the real UI harness.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changes the planned files.\n\nChangelog: The operation source dropdown shows Selection for face and edge picks.\n\nFixes #2982\n",
